{"id":"en_the-ring-chose-the-wrong-bride","title":"The Ring Chose the Wrong Bride","titleEn":"The Ring Chose the Wrong Bride","description":"A stolen ring sets off a chain of events that devastates Ingrid Shaw. Following a crash, Lena Zane exploits the Shaw Family Crest ring to pass herself off as the family's daughter-in-law, keeping the doctors occupied while Ingrid's pregnant mother dies and Ingrid is left at an orphanage. Twelve years on, Ingrid has risen to become Lena's trusted right hand, positioning herself to take back everything that was taken from her. The question is whether Lena will realize what is coming.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ring-chose-the-wrong-bride/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ring-chose-the-wrong-bride/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Mistaken Identity","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det8y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-ring-chose-the-wrong-bride_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det8y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ring-chose-the-wrong-bride_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det8y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ring-chose-the-wrong-bride_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det8y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ring-chose-the-wrong-bride_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embe